+# SIP scanner implementation plan
+
+Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-06-cc-sip-scanner-design.md. Native execution, approved in conversation. Platform base 1e32fd9, Command Center base 2f7bef3. Constraints: Schwab stock data, Redis durability, authenticated/fresh result, unchanged trading/risk capital, isolated feature branches, no production deployment/merge.
+
+## Task 1: Pure contract and calculation
+
+Create src/lib/sip/contract.ts, calendar.ts, calculation.ts; tests in src/lib/sip/__tests__/calculation.test.ts. Interfaces: SipBar {t:number,o:number,h:number,l:number,c:number,v:number}; PreparationRow {symbol,atr14,avg_vol,opening_mean}; SipCandidate {symbol,price,rvol,atr14,avg_vol}; SipSnapshot v1 with date/window/coverage. Export previousSessions(date,count), clock(now), preparationFromBars(symbol,date,daily,minute), rankCandidates(rows), stockUniverse(). RED: precise 2x opening ratio, exclusion at thresholds, partial/missing/duplicate/nonfinite bars, 14 prior sessions, holiday/DST and ETF exclusion. Implement only after RED, run focused Vitest, commit.
+
+## Task 2: Read-only provider and durable storage
+
+Create src/lib/sip/schwab.ts, store.ts and tests. Provider exposes dailyBars, historyMinutes, openingMinutes, quotes; dependency-injected fetch and existing getAccessToken/invalidate pair. Redis store exposes prepared rows, prepare summary, immutable result and lock(callback) with unique lease ownership. RED: endpoint whitelist, one 401 retry, timeout/status-safe failure, Redis required, date keys, partial progress, SET NX and compare-delete lock. Implement, run focused tests, commit.
+
+## Task 3: Service, routes, scheduler
+
+Create src/lib/sip/service.ts, auth.ts, cron.ts; routes /api/cron/cc-sip-scanner and /api/internal/cc/sip-scanner; tests service.test.ts/routes.test.ts. Service receives explicit provider/store/clock dependencies, prepares 4 concurrent symbols with deadline, publishes after complete window and persists honest coverage/errors. Cron ET guards + existing run logger; machine reads stored snapshots only. Add two logical expressions and one policy; increment governed inventory counts (98->100, 91->92). RED: disabled/auth/not-ready/ready-empty/storage/provider failures, no live calls on read, overlapping/repeated runs, incomplete prep, DST and holidays. Implement, run focused tests plus npm run cron:check and control-plane:check, commit.
+
+## Task 4: Command Center consumer and paper loop
+
+Modify bots/sip_orb/sip_scanner.py and cc_sdk/cc_sdk/intraday.py; add/update scanner and session readiness tests. Add UniversePending type in intraday; strict authenticated v1 client with SCANNER_SECRET, 300-second age and exact ET window. Normal poll retries until 09:40; scanner failure at deadline persists and keeps health degraded while exits continue. Update env example and operator docs. RED: delayed snapshot, 202/429/500, deadline, wrong date/window/age/future/nonfinite rows, secret-safe errors, no redirects, ready empty, exits during pending, actual SipOrbRules->risk->paper fill->EOD exit. Run focused and full Python suites, commit.
+
+## Task 5: Integration, review and delivery
+
+Cross-language deterministic fixture snapshots plus actual paper-loop integration; run platform focused suite and broad appropriate checks, platform build/typecheck, cron/registry checks, Python full suite and browser harness sequentially. Request one independent read-only reviewer; fix important findings with RED/GREEN. Prepare platform review branch and Command Center incremental bundle/native helper; verify remote readback. No live scanner calls without credentials and no installed-on-Windows claim until native evidence. Save reusable cloud setup if changed. Native server/scanner credentials and portfolio capital are outstanding deployment prerequisites.
+
+## Review Focus
+
+- Stock list classification completeness and ETF exclusion.
+- Historical gaps/duplicates are not fabricated zeros or inconsistent per-minute denominators.
+- Redis lock expiry and overlapping jobs cannot corrupt prepared rows or overwrite immutable results.
+- Complete history and publication boundaries work across DST/holidays and cold starts.
+- Pending universe never bypasses risk controls or blocks adopted-position exits; healthy zero remains distinct from unavailable data.
